# Line endings are pinned rather than left to each contributor's
# core.autocrlf setting.
#
# tests/corpus holds a frozen corpus whose whole point is that it is exact:
# the matrices are hex-float literals that must round-trip bit for bit, and
# the reference spectra beside them were computed once by LAPACK. A file whose
# bytes depend on the platform it was checked out on is not frozen. Pinning
# also keeps tools/check_symbols.sh runnable, since a shell script checked out
# with CRLF fails on every line.
#
# The rule is repository-wide so that regenerating the corpus with
# tools/make_corpus.py reproduces the committed bytes on any platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Hex-float corpus files: text, but never touched by any filter.
tests/corpus/*.txt text eol=lf

tools/*.sh text eol=lf
